Date: Wed, 14 Jan 2026 12:55:22 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] d3dx11: Implement D3DX11CreateThreadPump().

Signed-off-by: Connor McAdams <cmcadams@codeweavers.com>

CW-Bug-Id: #20442
CW-Bug-Id: #23084
CW-Bug-Id: #23301
(cherry picked from commit 5a82fd04ecdd180cfed6a7f28f08d5d959a58fd1)

mproton-resolved: 11.20's texture.c no longer includes initguid.h, so define the IIDs async.c uses here
